        {
            "type": "text",
            "content" : "Sophie passed away on 28th October 2025. She died in the garden she loved so much, peacefully on a sunny autumn afternoon."
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "Nothing will replace the light that Sophie brought to this world. She had a truly unique personality and was thoroughly loved by all who knew her."
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "Sophie was a careful, loving, and highly intelligent cat. She never caused any trouble, and was always a great joy to be around."
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "Enjoy the following photos and videos in memory of Sophie, a truly special cat."
