    "passed_in": "2025-10-28",
    "profile_photo": "sophie_sitting_on_sofa__9tuKYqCUkQk8.webp",
    "story": "Born at the Cats Protection League in 2010, Sophie was quickly adopted by the Shakespeare family. She was an incredibly loving and loyal companion. She was a very vocal cat and loved to talk to her humans. Despite being rather nervous at times, she was a very affectionate cat and loved to sit by people. She was a very intelligent cat and knew exactly how to trick and con people into getting exactly what she wanted. Enjoy the photos and videos of this strange but lovely cat.",
